    "unit_kind": "paragraph"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "根据2019年11月22日我国药监局正式发布的《个例安全性报告E2B（R3）区域实施指南》，不良事件的结果可有如下状态：①痊愈；②好转/缓解；③未好转/未缓解/持续；④痊愈伴后遗症；⑤致死；⑥未知。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "不良事件的随访"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-6e961f674f48ee5003dcc014",
    "package_ordinal": 97,
    "role": "owned",
    "source_ref": "body.p1148",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p1148"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-54537c69350c6f73d5539567",
    "unit_kind": "paragraph"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "不良事件的“结果”针对的是不良事件本身的状态，而非不良事件在医学意义上的状态，因此：",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "不良事件的随访"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-6e961f674f48ee5003dcc014",
    "package_ordinal": 97,
    "role": "owned",
    "source_ref": "body.p1149",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p1149"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-a0a2d3b39e7b7fcc26d95a17",
    "unit_kind": "paragraph"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "痊愈：指不良事件消失。无论参与者的基线情况是否异常，当不良事件恢复至基线时，即为痊愈。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "不良事件的随访"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-efb197cc99ae53ab03b9a1a2",
    "package_ordinal": 98,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p1150",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p1150"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-6514c434b7d574e83f69219c",
    "unit_kind": "list_item"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "好转/缓解：指不良事件减轻或缓解，在报告时还未消失。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "不良事件的随访"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-efb197cc99ae53ab03b9a1a2",
    "package_ordinal": 98,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p1151",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p1151"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-6fa336f8c64c45509f9c108f",
    "unit_kind": "list_item"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "未好转/未缓解/持续：指不良事件在报告时仍未减轻或缓解。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "不良事件的随访"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-efb197cc99ae53ab03b9a1a2",
    "package_ordinal": 98,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p1152",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p1152"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-89c01672102f771c1f8a3d0a",
    "unit_kind": "list_item"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "伴后遗症：指不良事件导致长期的或永久的生理机能障碍。不应将恢复期或恢复阶段的某些症状视为后遗症。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "不良事件的随访"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-efb197cc99ae53ab03b9a1a2",
    "package_ordinal": 98,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p1153",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p1153"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-1bfbb68fd2fe7829275b7c80",
    "unit_kind": "list_item"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "致死：指参与者因该不良事件导致死亡。如果参与者同时报告有多个不良事件，其中仅一个不良事件导致死亡，其它未导致死亡的不良事件的结果不应选择死亡。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "不良事件的随访"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-efb197cc99ae53ab03b9a1a2",
    "package_ordinal": 98,
